## Tech stack

| Layer | Technology |
|-------|-----------|
| Frontend | React 19, Vite, TypeScript (strict), Ant Design, TanStack Query |
| Backend | Django 5, Django REST Framework, drf-spectacular, Python ≥ 3.13, uv |
{{#if withPostgres}}
| Database | PostgreSQL (Django migrations) |
{{else}}
| Database | SQLite (dev default — Django migrations) |
{{/if}}
{{#if withS3}}
| Object storage | S3 via django-storages (MinIO locally) |
{{/if}}
{{#if withCelery}}
| Async jobs | Celery, Redis, Flower |
{{/if}}
| Infra | Docker Compose, Dockerfiles for frontend and backend |
| Testing | pytest + pytest-django · Playwright + Cucumber |
| Security | Bandit · Semgrep · Trivy |
| Docs | MkDocs Material |
